@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 60 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "墙钟时间" as T
concise "计划区间" as P
concise "Range .active" as A
concise "安全输出" as S

@0
T is "07:58"
P is "开始前"
A is "非活动"
S is "OFF"

@2
T is "08:00"
P is "range(10min)"

@6
T is "08:04"
A is "活动"
S is "ON"

@8
T is "08:06"
S is "被阻止"

@10
T is "08:08"
S is "ON"

@12
T is "08:10"
P is "已结束"
A is "非活动"
S is "OFF"

@14
T is "08:12"

P@2 <-> @12 : 计划 [08:00, 08:10)
A@6 <-> @12 : 08:04 延迟准入：剩余 6 分钟
S@8 <-> @10 : 安全阻止，不在末尾补加
@enduml
